#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_1F/scripts.inc:121
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_1F_Text_WallyNotGoingToLoseAnymore"
msgid ""
"WALLY: Hi! {PLAYER}!\p"
"I bet you're surprised to see me here!\p"
"I made it all the way here, and it's\n"
"all thanks to you!\p"
"{PLAYER}, losing to you that time\n"
"made me stronger!\p"
"But I'm not going to lose anymore!\p"
"I'm going to win! For the POKéMON who\n"
"gave me courage and strength!\p"
"Okay… Here I come!$"
msgstr ""
"满充：你好！{PLAYER}！\p"
"在这里见到我，你一定很惊讶吧！\p"
"我能一路走到这里，\n"
"全都是多亏了你！\p"
"{PLAYER}，那次输给你，\n"
"让我变得更强了！\p"
"但是，我不会再输了！\p"
"我要赢！为了给了我\n"
"勇气和力量的宝可梦！\p"
"好了……我要上了！$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_1F/scripts.inc:133
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_1F_Text_WallyEntranceDefeat"
msgid ""
"Wow!\n"
"{PLAYER}, you are strong, after all!$"
msgstr ""
"哇！\n"
"{PLAYER}，你果然很强！$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_1F/scripts.inc:137
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_1F_Text_WallyPostEntranceBattle"
msgid ""
"WALLY: I couldn't beat you today,\n"
"{PLAYER}, but one of these days, I'll\l"
"catch up to you!$"
msgstr ""
"满充：今天我没能打败你，\n"
"{PLAYER}，但总有一天，\l"
"我会追上你的！$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_1F/scripts.inc:142
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_1F_Text_WallyIntro"
msgid ""
"WALLY: Hi! {PLAYER}!\p"
"I've gotten stronger since that last\n"
"time! I wanted to show you, {PLAYER}!\p"
"Okay… Here I come!$"
msgstr ""
"满充：你好！{PLAYER}！\p"
"自从上次以后，我变得更强了！\n"
"我想让{PLAYER}看看！\p"
"好了……我要上了！$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_1F/scripts.inc:148
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_1F_Text_WallyDefeat"
msgid ""
"Wow!\n"
"{PLAYER}, you are strong, after all!$"
msgstr ""
"哇！\n"
"{PLAYER}，你果然很强！$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_1F/scripts.inc:152
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_1F_Text_WallyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"WALLY: I couldn't beat you this time,\n"
"too… But one of these days, {PLAYER},\l"
"I'm going to catch up to you…\p"
"And challenge the POKéMON LEAGUE!$"
msgstr ""
"满充：这次我还是没能赢你……\n"
"但总有一天，{PLAYER}，\l"
"我一定会追上你的……\p"
"然后去挑战宝可梦联盟！$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_1F/scripts.inc:158
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_1F_Text_EdgarIntro"
msgid ""
"I've made it this far a couple times,\n"
"but the last stretch is so long…$"
msgstr ""
"我已经好几次走到这里了，\n"
"可是最后这段路实在太长了……$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_1F/scripts.inc:162
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_1F_Text_EdgarDefeat"
msgid "My dream ends here again…$"
msgstr "我的梦想又在这里结束了……$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_1F/scripts.inc:165
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_1F_Text_EdgarPostBattle"
msgid ""
"You've made it this far. Keep the\n"
"momentum going and become the\l"
"CHAMPION! If anyone can, it's you!$"
msgstr ""
"你已经走到这里了。\n"
"保持这股气势，成为冠军吧！\l"
"如果有谁能做到，那就是你！$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_1F/scripts.inc:170
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_1F_Text_AlbertIntro"
msgid ""
"I didn't come all this way to lose now.\n"
"That possibility doesn't exist!$"
msgstr ""
"我走了这么远，可不是来输的。\n"
"根本不存在那种可能！$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_1F/scripts.inc:174
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_1F_Text_AlbertDefeat"
msgid ""
"Impossible…\n"
"I lost?$"
msgstr ""
"不可能……\n"
"我输了？$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_1F/scripts.inc:178
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_1F_Text_AlbertPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I lost here…\p"
"That means I lack the qualifications\n"
"to become the CHAMPION…$"
msgstr ""
"我在这里输了……\p"
"这说明我没有资格\n"
"成为冠军……$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_1F/scripts.inc:183
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_1F_Text_HopeIntro"
msgid ""
"This seemingly infinite and harsh road\n"
"lives up to its name of VICTORY.$"
msgstr ""
"这条看似无穷无尽的艰险道路，\n"
"真不愧是冠军之路。$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_1F/scripts.inc:187
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_1F_Text_HopeDefeat"
msgid "Your battle style is fantastic…$"
msgstr "你的对战风格太精彩了……$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_1F/scripts.inc:190
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_1F_Text_HopePostBattle"
msgid ""
"You seem to have the potential for\n"
"becoming the CHAMPION.$"
msgstr "你似乎有成为冠军的潜力。$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_1F/scripts.inc:194
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_1F_Text_QuincyIntro"
msgid ""
"What is the VICTORY ROAD?\n"
"I'll tell you if you win!$"
msgstr ""
"冠军之路是什么？\n"
"你赢了我就告诉你！$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_1F/scripts.inc:198
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_1F_Text_QuincyDefeat"
msgid ""
"Okay!\n"
"Well done!$"
msgstr ""
"好！\n"
"干得好！$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_1F/scripts.inc:202
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_1F_Text_QuincyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Getting through here safely--that's\n"
"the final test for any TRAINER aiming\l"
"to become the POKéMON CHAMPION.\p"
"That's why it's called the VICTORY\n"
"ROAD.$"
msgstr ""
"平安通过这里——\n"
"就是每个立志成为宝可梦冠军的\l"
"训练家的最后考验。\p"
"所以这里才叫做冠军之路。$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_1F/scripts.inc:209
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_1F_Text_KatelynnIntro"
msgid ""
"I have nothing to say to anyone\n"
"that's come this far. Come on!$"
msgstr ""
"对走到这里的人，\n"
"我没什么好说的。来吧！$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_1F/scripts.inc:213
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_1F_Text_KatelynnDefeat"
msgid "This is a disgrace…$"
msgstr "真是耻辱……$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_1F/scripts.inc:216
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_1F_Text_KatelynnPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Humph, go right on ahead.\n"
"See if I care.$"
msgstr ""
"哼，你走吧。\n"
"我才不在乎呢。$"
